bold) (justify left)) (uuid 4ca7af7f-ed79-4872-9950-4ff3f2996da7)) (text "AP1 shared audio platform (rhymes player, star lamp, cricket game). ATmega328P at 8 MHz internal from 3xAA." (at 20 532.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 4038c926-fe22-46d6-85a6-219cb42e8a83)) (text "MP3 module: 1 k series on both UART lines, BUSY on D2. Seven buttons share ADC6 through a ladder (10 k pull-" (at 20 535.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid d2ebeaff-191e-487f-8100-23f1dc443834)) (text "up; 1 k ... 47 k to each button): decode one press at a time in the HAL. Display: bought-in 4-digit 74HC595" (at 20 539.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 538e521a-4264-426f-a573-5842ecae8eca)) (text "LED module on J11 (VCC SCLK RCLK DIO GND). U5 74HC595 drives the seven ball-lane LEDs and its QH' feeds the" (at 20 542.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 3789a5bc-bd8c-4bb2-9faf-d891e3ef3e61)) (text "module DIO, so one 24-bit frame is shifted per refresh: module segment byte, module digit byte, then the lane" (at 20 546 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 0dfa5d74-fcc7-4a47-88d1-3f09614f7faf)) (text "byte; latch on RCLK. SER/SRCLK/RCLK share MOSI/SCK/MISO with the ISP header (the module and U5 only see clocks" (at 20 549.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 58d4fb97-6b58-42fe-b0bd-f09423c1f6b5)) (text "while RCLK is low, harmless during ISP). Lamp: three AO3400A on PWM D3/D5/D6 to a common-anode LED; motor on" (at 20 552.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 2484bd34-9006-4a8a-8bfb-3b27b80c6861)) (text "D10 with SS14 flyback. Arduino tone() uses Timer2, which also drives D3: do not use the buzzer and red PWM" (at 20 556.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 007a05d2-91c3-4238-a2c7-46b3e33cfa36)) (text "together. Populate per product (see the manual)." (at 20 559.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid c8ff0727-abe1-4203-baee-d5138e57a256)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))